From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6125-xiaomi-ginkgo: retain ABL fixups

The ginkgo ABL path used by the tested postmarketOS image expects a zero
board-id and a wakegic symbol for the stock DTBO overlay. Keep both entries in
newly generated DTBs.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-ginkgo-common.dtsi | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-ginkgo-common.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-ginkgo-common.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-ginkgo-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-ginkgo-common.dtsi
@@ -24,6 +24,12 @@
 
 	qcom,msm-id = <QCOM_ID_SM6125 0x10000>;
 
+	qcom,board-id = <0 0>;
+
+	__symbols__ {
+		wakegic = "/soc@0/interrupt-controller@f200000";
+	};
+
 	aliases {
 		serial0 = &uart4;
 	};
-- 
2.43.0
